{"id":"n57998-1-8","stage":2,"title":"밟히다 · 被踩","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57998-1-8-1","ko":"신발이 왜 그렇게 지저분하니?","zh":"鞋子怎么这么脏啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신발이","meaning":"鞋","explanation":"신발：鞋；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"신발","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30213","senseId":"1","lemma":"신발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지저분하니?","meaning":"脏兮兮，肮脏","explanation":"지저분하다：脏兮兮，肮脏；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"지저분하다","audio":"/audio/8db48a7863a37c7a29f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27948","senseId":"2","lemma":"지저분하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"514d3c6f08937125","term":"신발","zh":"鞋","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3","entryId":"30213","definition":"站立或走路时为了保护脚而穿的东西。","pronunciation":["신발"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"8db48a7863a37c7a","term":"지저분하다","zh":"脏兮兮，肮脏","audio":"/audio/8db48a7863a37c7a29f1.mp3","entryId":"27948","definition":"不干净且脏得让人讨厌。","pronunciation":["지저분하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7c9559cffd4f93e26a21.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57998-1-8-2","ko":"지하철 안에서 어떤 남자한테 발을 밟혔어.","zh":"在地铁里被某个男人踩到脚了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지하철","meaning":"地铁","explanation":"지하철：地铁","readings":[{"term":"지하철","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71490","senseId":"1","lemma":"지하철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안에서","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"某个","explanation":"어떤：某个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"3","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남자한테","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발을","meaning":"足，脚","explanation":"발：足，脚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67886","senseId":"1","lemma":"발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밟혔어.","meaning":"被踩","explanation":"밟히다：被踩；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"밟히다","audio":"/audio/0558b818c5da21141baf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57998","senseId":"1","lemma":"밟히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfb8c73b9f048c3b","term":"지하철","zh":"地铁","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3","entryId":"71490","definition":"行驶在地下铁路的电动车。","pronunciation":["지하철"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"某个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"没有必要明确地指出是哪个对象时使用的话。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子，男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"作为男性出生的人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"45a4bd47fdb2ffcd","term":"발","zh":"足，脚","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3","entryId":"67886","definition":"人或动物腿部的最末端部分。","pronunciation":["발"]},{"id":"0558b818c5da2114","term":"밟히다","zh":"被踩","audio":"/audio/0558b818c5da21141baf.mp3","entryId":"57998","definition":"被压在脚下。","pronunciation":["발피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7052fab126da18adb693.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57998","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":68,"sequenceScore":1.8053,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["鞋子怎么这么脏啊？","在地铁里被某个男人踩到脚了。","面包要分成几块呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["鞋子怎么这么脏啊？","在地铁里被某个男人踩到脚了。","面包要分成几块呢？"],"answer":1}]}
